# A reachability server, a hub and an active client on the internet; a behind a
# home router that runs miniupnpd, b behind a symmetric NAT without one (so b
# reaches a only by dialling it: traversal cannot work through r2).
net wan
net home1
net home2
node r1   router wan.11 home1.254 nat=home upnp=on
node r2   router wan.12 home2.254 nat=symmetric
node drop drop wan.40
node hub  public wan.20
node w    public wan.30
node a    client home1.10
node b    client home2.10
